- Has `columns` and `cards` tables.
- Has `GET /api/board`.
- Has `POST /api/cards`.
- Has `PATCH /api/cards/:id/move`.
- Has `GET /api/stream` for SSE.
- Handles collisions and precision issues (to some extent).
- Uses transactions for atomic moves.

The frontend:
- Uses Vite.
- Fetches board on load.
- Renders columns and cards.
